      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***A SUPERB THREE BEDROOM SEMI-DETACHED FAMILY HOME, FULLY REFURBISHED, BRIGHT AND VERY SPACIOUS, QUIET CUL-DE-SAC LOCATION CLOSE TO A LARGE COMMUNAL GREEN, WALKING DISTANCE TO THE CITYWEST SHOPPING CENTRE AND LUAS, NO ONWARD CHAIN***\n\n**Some Images are virtually staged\"\"\n\nByrne Malone Estate Agents are delighted to present 22 Corbally Rise to the market, for sale with NO ONWARD CHAIN. This fabulous three bedroom, three bathroom family home, with attic room, has been completely refurbished (newly painted, new flooring and carpets, new windows and doors and a new boiler) and comes to the market in excellent condition throughout. Ideally located on a quiet cul-de-sac all local amenities are very close by (local shops, schools, parks and leisure facilities) The LUAS and Citywest Shopping Centre are just a short stroll away with the N81, N7 and M50 just minutes away by car.\n\nThis bright and spacious (over 1,000 sq feet) home comprises of a sitting room, a lovely, open-plan kitchen/diner, three great size bedrooms with en-suite to main bedroom, attic room, family bathroom, utility room and downstairs cloakroom/W.C. To the rear is a good size garden and to the front a driveway providing off-street parking for two cars. There is a large, well maintained communal green space at the end of the road.\n\nMany additional benefits include full double glazing throughout, gas-fired heating, fitted wardrobes, enclosed porch and alarm.\n\nTo view this exceptional property please call us on 01 912 5500"
      },
